%N A397962 Complement of A397805: numbers that have fewer than 3 divisors that are smaller than the square of their least prime factor.
%C A397962 1 is included as 1 has fewer than 3 divisors irrespective of the applicability of the condition about the size of the divisors.
%C A397962 Includes all powers of primes (A000961). The second smallest distinct prime factor of all other terms is greater than the square of the least prime factor.
